# Agent shell discipline (Windows)

Canonical shell rules — **`block_until_ms` tiers**, lifecycle, git, compile verification, cleanup, parallel shells, and **terminal heartbeat** — live in **`shell-hygiene.mdc`** and **`shell-heartbeat.mdc`**. Execution parallelism (subagents) lives in **`Agent-Execution-Policy.mdc`**.

Follow **`shell-hygiene.mdc`**, **`shell-heartbeat.mdc`**, and **`Agent-Execution-Policy.mdc`** in full for every agent turn that uses **`Shell`** or **`Task`**.
